<section class="booksy-alt__section" aria-labelledby="booksy-alt-switch-title">
  <div class="booksy-alt__glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <header class="booksy-alt__intro">
      <p class="booksy-alt__eyebrow">SWITCHING FROM BOOKSY</p>
      <h2 id="booksy-alt-switch-title" class="booksy-alt__h2">
        You don’t need to switch everything overnight.
      </h2>
      <p class="booksy-alt__lead">
        Keep your current booking setup live while your KERSIVO setup is prepared.
      </p>
      <p class="booksy-alt__lead">
        We’ll help migrate the usable business data available from your current system, including
        supported exports. The exact migration depends on what data your current provider makes
        available.
      </p>
      <p class="booksy-alt__lead">
        Once you’ve reviewed your KERSIVO setup and you’re ready to launch, the booking journey can
        move across.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="booksy-alt-panels">
      <article class="booksy-alt-panel">
        <p class="booksy-alt-panel__label">CURRENT SYSTEM</p>
        <h3 class="booksy-alt-panel__title">Keep Booksy live</h3>
        <p class="booksy-alt-panel__body">
          Continue taking bookings through your current setup while KERSIVO is prepared.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="booksy-alt-panel booksy-alt-panel--kersivo">
        <p class="booksy-alt-panel__label">WHEN YOU’RE READY</p>
        <h3 class="booksy-alt-panel__title">Move the journey</h3>
        <p class="booksy-alt-panel__body">
          Review your KERSIVO setup first. Launch when you approve — then update your public booking
          links.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="booksy-alt-switch__support">Keep Booksy live until you’re ready.</p>
  </div>
</section>
